    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game:</h2><br>xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx<br>&quot;I've always been looking at you from afar.<br><br>I began to like you from the moment we first met,<br><br>and I can't keep my feelings hidden anymore.<br><br>Please come to the big cherry tree after class.<br><br>I want to tell you how I feel.&quot;<br><br>xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx<br><br><strong>\ud83e\udd0dMy new girlfriend is so cute and sweet. I can't believe such a nice girl likes me so much. But... would she still want to be with me if she knew what I'm into? \ud83e\udd0d</strong>  <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    A heart-pounding horror visual novel telling the story of you and your new girlfriend.<br></li><li>    Pick the name of your friend and girlfriend, as well your own name.<br></li><li>    Your choices determine what kind of story you'll get to see in each playthrough.<br></li><li>    Featuring six different endings. Aim to see them all...?</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449820/extras/96b5fee9b6b6c768d1ba3b083b474972.avif?t=1726421279\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449820/extras/021f8515f18e4875929bd98d74888f24.avif?t=1726421279\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2449820/extras/caf894eda92bd7c4d56c93bc2d1d36bc.avif?t=1726421279\" /></span><br><br><br>---------------------------------------------<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Meiri Games:</h2><br>I'm a solo Brazilian game developer who enjoys making cute horror games. MyGF is my first Steam release! I hope you enjoy this short adventure.",
